<title>USA: Spotsylvania Cty, Va., won by Goldman.</title>
<headline>Spotsylvania Cty, Va., won by Goldman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said it won $49 million of the Spotsylvania County, Va., water and sewer system revenue bonds series 1997, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.459 percent.</p>
</text>
